{
  "$comment": [
    "Which browser spec files to run for a change (docs/change-sop.md, quick verify). Owned by the Test role.",
    "How to read it: take every changed path; for each, every area whose 'paths' glob matches adds its 'specs'.",
    "The smoke set (tests tagged @smoke) always runs as well. A path no area matches adds nothing: smoke only (see 'default').",
    "Globs: '**' any depth, '*' within one folder. Spec names are files in tests/browser/. 'specs': ['*'] means every spec file.",
    "Lanes (handover, UX rows 1-25): A player's phone (tickets, cue, claim); B host calling, claims, payouts, settings, summary; C host setup and hand-out. 'shared' areas belong to no lane: a change there reaches several lanes."
  ],
